            <div xml:id="d384">

                <pb facs="0383" n="267" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg267"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.00/844.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Consul at
                            Santiago to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase. ]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santiago, Cuba</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-06-28T06:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 28, 1912—6 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The rebel leader Estenoz was killed yesterday in a battle at Micara. His body was
                    brought here and positively identified.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Holaday</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
